        "text": "Scenario B"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h3"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003i",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003h",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "Email: jane@fortune500.com"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal",
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003k",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003j",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "Title: VP of Engineering"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal",
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003m",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003l",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "Predicted Sale LTV: $50,000"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal",
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003o",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003n",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "Lead Signal Sent: value = $300"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal",
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003q",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003p",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "Outcome: Algorithm aggressively bids for similar profiles"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal",
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003s",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003r",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "This approach trains the system on what quality looks like at the moment the lead is created."
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003u",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003t",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "The Value Curve: Why This Works"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003w",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003v",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "It teaches AI that not all leads are equal. As the AI learns which specific signals result in high proxy values, targeting becomes more advanced and quality of leads becomes more valuable. This allows your data pipeline to move from “more leads” to “better leads.”"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl003z",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl003x",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [
          "strong"
        ],
        "text": "Bidding for Lead Volume (tCPA/Max Conversions)"
      },
      {
        "_key": "ctl003y",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": ": This strategy creates a “race to the bottom.” The algorithm is incentivized to find the cheapest possible leads regardless of quality. As you try to scale, the system scrapes the bottom of the barrel for low-intent users just to hit your cost target. The result is that volume goes up, but lead quality and ROAS goes down."
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal",
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl0042",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl0040",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [
          "strong"
        ],
        "text": "Bidding for Value: Value-Based Bidding (tROAS/Max Conversion Value)"
      },
      {
        "_key": "ctl0041",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": ": This strategy teaches the algorithm to find your most valuable users. As you give the system more information, it goes out and hunts for more value. When you scale, ROAS remains high because the algorithm uses that increased volume to learn which signals correlate with high-value outcomes."
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal",
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl0045",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl0043",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "Conclusion: "
      },
      {
        "_key": "ctl0044",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [
          "em"
        ],
        "text": "Data Doesn’t Win. Activated Data Wins."
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl0047",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl0046",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "If pixels were the start of performance marketing, CAPI is the upgrade that keeps it alive. But CAPI alone only closes the loop; value-based bidding transforms it."
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl0049",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl0048",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "When you send richer, faster, more accurate truth back to the platforms, and pair it with engineered proxy values, you unlock a level of algorithmic performance that simply isn’t possible with legacy CPA models."
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl004b",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl004a",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [
          "strong"
        ],
        "text": "This is the new playbook:"
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl004d",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl004c",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "Build the pipes → Deduplicate → Reduce latency → Train on value, not volume."
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
  },
  {
    "_key": "ctl004f",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
      {
        "_key": "ctl004e",
        "_type": "span",
        "marks": [],
        "text": "If your ad platforms can’t see qualified leads or revenue, they can’t optimize for growth. Found helps organizations audit their first-party data, CRM integrations, and signal flow to uncover gaps holding revenue back."
      }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
  }
]
